{
	"name": "Pixie Dust",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/commodities/materials/powder-black.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 7th level, the fey can produce and wield pixie dust. A pinch of pixie dust can be sprinkled as an action to create one of the following effects once per short rest. Any other creature that attempts to use the pixie dust is instead affected by it.</p><p><strong>Broken Heart.</strong> One creature within 5ft must make a Wisdom save or be [[/condition id=charmed]] by the next creature they see, determined randomly, for one minute.</p><p><strong>Flight.</strong> Up to 3 allied creatures within 5ft gain a fly speed of 30ft for up to 1 minute. This effect ends early if they land.</p><p><strong>Slumber.</strong> All creatures in a 10ft cube within 5ft must make a Wisdom save or collapse into sleep for up to one minute. Sleeping creatures are awakened by any damage, particularly loud noises, contact with water, or when jostled as an action.</p>",
